# Cost and limits

- Batch size is `SIGNAL_BATCH_SIZE` (default 25). Do not send unbounded prompts.
- Enforce `SIGNAL_DAILY_SPEND_CAP_USD` (default 25) in code before each model or TTS call. The estimate uses `GROK_INPUT_USD_PER_MILLION`, `GROK_OUTPUT_USD_PER_MILLION`, and `GROK_TTS_USD_PER_MILLION_CHARS`.
- When the next call would exceed the cap, raise the circuit breaker, stop the job, and return a structured error. Do not keep calling the API.
- LLM calls happen inside ticket classification, external search, and voice synthesis. Anomaly detection stays statistical and does not call the model.
- Record estimated spend on the case file. A demo run with the mock client reports zero spend and a separate live-call estimate.
